            this extension is the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+2-group"} string 2-group
          %p
            Such a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+theory"} Lie theoretic
            situation is concisely expressed by a diagram of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+homotopy+types"} smooth homotopy types
            of the form
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mrow
                    %mtable
