          #InterpretationOfTildeHatG.num_remark
            %h6#remark_6 Remark
            %p
              Corollary
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TildeHatGIsDifferentialModuliBundle"}
              says that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
